## ⚙️ CORE ARCHITECTURAL FACTS FOR ENGAGEMENT BOT (DOWNSTREAM AGENT RAW KNOWLEDGE BASE)
- **Project Identity Handle**: membership-hub.
- **Core Architecture & Infrastructure Topology**:
  - Java/Quarkus microservices containerized with Docker (<500MB NFR-005).
  - Deployed on GKE with Istio service mesh for traffic routing.
  - Auth service (ARC-006) implements OAuth2 (Firebase/Google/Facebook), JWT access tokens (15m), refresh tokens (7d).
  - Attendance QR service (ARC-007) uses Redis pub/sub for idempotent scan processing (EXC-002).
  - Notification service (ARC-008) pushes to FCM/APNs and Zalo groups via event-driven queue.
  - Frontend Next.js (ARC-009) consumes REST APIs, bearer token auth, offline caching via IndexedDB.
  - Multi-language support via i18next, hreflang SEO (REQ-023).
  - CI/CD via GitHub Actions, automated security scans.
- **Database & Distributed Caching Capabilities**:
  - PostgreSQL 15 sharded per center, read replicas for reporting (NFR-004).
  - Redis cluster for session cache, attendance deduplication keys (EXC-002), TTL 5m.
  - Core API latency <200ms (NFR-001), DB reads <100ms via indexes.
- **Enterprise Security & Compliance Controls**:
  - TLS 1.3, AES-256 at rest, JWT signed RS256.
  - OWASP Top 10 mitigations: prepared statements, CSP, CSRF tokens.
  - RBAC matrix (ARC-001–ARC-005) enforced at API gateway.
  - Audit logging (NFR-006) to `auditlog` table, retention 1 year.
  - GDPR/CCPA pipelines (NFR-008) for data deletion and export.
  - Network policies, firewall rules, rate limiting 100 req/min per IP.
- **Target Audience Pain Points Coverage**:
  - System Admin: centralized visibility, role delegation → solved by RBAC + audit logs.
  - Center Admin: per-center control, no cross-center interference → solved by center-scoped JWT + DB sharding.
  - Manager: announcement creation, student assignment → solved by Manager role APIs (REQ-003) + notification queue.
  - Teacher: read-only schedule → solved by Teacher microservice (ARC-004) with cached course lists.
  - Student: course browsing, enrollment, QR attendance, card validity → solved by Student-facing mobile/web (REQ-010, REQ-011, REQ-012, REQ-014, REQ-015) with offline caching and idempotent attendance.
  - Mobile App User: responsive UI, push notifications, QR scanning → solved by Capacitor hybrid app, FCM/APNs integration, native QR plugin.